    questionText: "The phase \\( \\phi(t) = i\\big(t + \\tfrac13 t^3\\big) \\) has saddles where \\( \\phi'=0 \\). Find the saddle points, the value of \\( \\phi \\) at each, and the curvature \\( \\phi'' \\) there.",
